fixture jump_on_cling_frame_kicks
doc docs/adr/0010, the wall (movement review 4, M5): jump pressed with the stick toward the wall on the tick the fall reaches it and clings, the air jump unspent. A press on that tick is a press on the wall: it waits for the cling and kicks off it, keeping the air jump, as with the air jump spent. (It used to fire the air jump 6.4 u short of the wall.)
room test/shaft
spawn 760 300
frames 30
input
  0..5 R
  6 R jump
  7..29 R jump
end
expect
  at 6 event.wall_kick=1
  at 6 air_jumps=1
end
